title: Tomasz Arciszewski
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
card-image: img/polish/arciszewski.jpg
view-if: arciszewski_advisor = 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// Adviser actions of technical reference 10.4.3 (card catalogue 6.6): 0 T, their own R, one shared cooldown of
// six months for all advisers (4.4); the effects are the approved P numbers, applied by PolishParty.
PolishParty.advisorView(Q, 'arciszewski');
!}

= Tomasz Arciszewski

Arciszewski represents Centrum PPS while maintaining strong connections to workers and the affiliated trade-union movement.

- @organize_workers
- @labour_programme
- @welfare_programme
- @root: Return to main

@organize_workers
title: Organize the Workers
subtitle: 1 R; one union branch +8 reach; PPS gains among the workers it covers (+3 base).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'arciszewski', 'organize_workers').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_organize_workers_why +]
go-to: organize_menu

@organize_menu
new-page: true

= Organize the workers: which branch?

- @organize_industry
- @organize_rail
- @organize_farm_labour
- @arciszewski: Back.

@organize_industry
title: Industry
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'arciszewski', 'organize_workers', 'industry');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@organize_rail
title: Railways
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'arciszewski', 'organize_workers', 'rail');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@organize_farm_labour
title: Agricultural labour
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'arciszewski', 'organize_workers', 'farm_labour');
